  "description": "Adds an operational observability layer to the Hangfire Dashboard.\n\t\t\tMonitor your background jobs with a live summary grouped by job type,\n\t\t\tshowing recent execution statuses (success/failure), average durations,\n\t\t\tand a detailed history view with client-side pagination and search.\n\t\t\tIncludes an interactive chart panel for duration trends and throughput\n\t\t\t(executions & success rate) over multiple time ranges, configurable\n\t\t\talerts, and built-in data retention management.\n\t\t\tDesigned to work within the native Hangfire ecosystem without external\n\t\t\tdependencies.",
